// Percentile measures (P50/P90/P95/P99) — standard practice in every LLM
// observability tool researched (Helicone ships latency percentiles and
// per-user tracking by default), and a better summary than a mean for
// right-skewed data like cost-per-request and token counts, where a
// handful of large requests pull the mean upward. ADDITIVE — put these
// alongside the existing average-based measures, not instead of them;
// mean and P50 disagreeing by a lot is itself a useful signal of skew.
//
// No new columns needed. This repo's usage schema has no latency field
// (see src/usage-ingestion-logicapp/llm-usage-ingestion/workflow.json —
// promptTokens/responseTokens/totalTokens/cost, no request duration) —
// only cost and token-count percentiles are built here; add latency
// percentiles later if/when a duration field gets added to the pipeline.
//
// PERFORMANCE NOTE: PERCENTILEX.INC sorts the full filtered table — cheap
// on a single model/day slice, potentially slow unfiltered at the
// "billions of tokens" scale this platform targets. Use these on
// filtered/drillthrough views (Model Detail, a specific date range), not
// as an unfiltered whole-history KPI tile on a high-traffic page.

// ============================================================
// COST PER REQUEST
// ============================================================

P50 Cost Per Request = PERCENTILEX.INC('llm-usage-container', 'llm-usage-container'[cost.totalCost], 0.5)

P90 Cost Per Request = PERCENTILEX.INC('llm-usage-container', 'llm-usage-container'[cost.totalCost], 0.9)

P95 Cost Per Request = PERCENTILEX.INC('llm-usage-container', 'llm-usage-container'[cost.totalCost], 0.95)

P99 Cost Per Request = PERCENTILEX.INC('llm-usage-container', 'llm-usage-container'[cost.totalCost], 0.99)

Cost Tail Ratio (P95/P50) = DIVIDE([P95 Cost Per Request], [P50 Cost Per Request])
// A single skewness summary: close to 1 means the cost distribution is
// tight around the median; a high ratio means a handful of expensive
// requests dominate — worth knowing before trusting [Avg Cost per
// Request] as "typical."

// ============================================================
// PROMPT (INPUT) TOKENS
// ============================================================

P50 Prompt Tokens = PERCENTILEX.INC('llm-usage-container', 'llm-usage-container'[promptTokens], 0.5)

P95 Prompt Tokens = PERCENTILEX.INC('llm-usage-container', 'llm-usage-container'[promptTokens], 0.95)

P99 Prompt Tokens = PERCENTILEX.INC('llm-usage-container', 'llm-usage-container'[promptTokens], 0.99)

// ============================================================
// TOTAL TOKENS
// ============================================================

P50 Total Tokens = PERCENTILEX.INC('llm-usage-container', 'llm-usage-container'[totalTokens], 0.5)

P95 Total Tokens = PERCENTILEX.INC('llm-usage-container', 'llm-usage-container'[totalTokens], 0.95)

P99 Total Tokens = PERCENTILEX.INC('llm-usage-container', 'llm-usage-container'[totalTokens], 0.99)
